==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY|Cloyster|32}} from the {{TCG|XY}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Cloyster}}.
*'''Guard Press''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unleashed|Steelix|24}} from the {{TCG|Unleashed}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

